{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4febc688b947685a92caf417425b3a1d6f8670aa8de53b5b8a712a2a824842c4", "ja": "次の公演のセンターに選ばれた奈緒。\nアイドルらしいトークのために、と特訓した\n『東京弁』を披露するが上手くいかない。\nしかし、大事なのはいつもの自分だと気づき\n関西弁のままで見事に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "奈绪被选为下次公演的Center。\n她为了让讲话更有偶像的感觉，而特别练习\n『东京腔』，却无法在大家面前流畅地表达。\n然而，她察觉最重要的是展现平常的自己后，\n用原本的关西腔顺利完成了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f7ea47c749c613684369776315eebdce1d4f76db6a5a6dee9a8275deae35d6a0", "ja": "（次の公演のセンターは奈緒……だいぶ気合いが\n入っているみたいだけど、調子はどうかな？）", "zh": "（下次公演的Center是奈绪……\n虽然她看起来很有干劲，但不知道状况如何？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "8eb38dc8b0112be3859d9ba3e36f364bbd9d71df71e87ff19ea007f43c295ed8", "ja": "ふんふふんふ～ん♪　ふふふ～ん♪", "zh": "哼哼哼哼～♪哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "836d0166cf6e7dcbbaa8bfd4b56b23d05101adab4ba6cbe61f464bef3817411f", "ja": "ふふっ。奈緒ちゃん、ご機嫌だね？", "zh": "呵呵，小绪，你心情很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "57bd508c6de118a6b62dd94dfa5ceae1d1c9e86bf3f6be1a4bd9c8341f3136d8", "ja": "そりゃな～。\nなんたってセンターやし！", "zh": "当然啊～\n因为我要当Center啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "60b60e4ecf905af89ddd7474c7d329ca38e04195437fe78708f2c6497cd58975", "ja": "センターの景色はどんなんやろな～って……\n想像するだけで、やる気がみなぎってくるわ～。", "zh": "Center会看到什么样的景色……\n光是用想像的，我整个人就充满了动力啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1efc1cb82a3700d643a2edf03193038c87cfe464c9c7f0674b3fac27dc2d8f66", "ja": "やる気いっぱいだな、奈緒！\nその調子で頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "很有干劲喔，奈绪！\n保持这个状态，继续加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "64d785ba146fd05bef2087b03e9be7d2f0355507f154967b2a30bfe562b61eb7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございます♪", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生！\n早安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "73be38a8794796159ddb6b694e127787b68a82424b330d7b1a7bbdc784021255", "ja": "もしかして、レッスン見に来てくれたんですか？\nえへへ……よっしゃ、ますます気合い入ってきたわ！", "zh": "难道说你是来看我练习的吗？\n嘿嘿嘿……好，这下越来越有干劲啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "48169559690ccbd56358a8130bbcb9bd081a7d3c5660fa1c675c002ba703dd21", "ja": "レッスン頑張るで～！　お～！！", "zh": "我要努力练习～！喔～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "7c027ff75de79fa6a246df7fab2fe996058590f657c94055a1f0fa156fa6fcb0", "ja": "おー！　アタシと美奈子も、ばっちり手伝うからね。\nみんなで、奈緒のセンター公演を成功させよう！", "zh": "喔──！我和美奈子也会尽全力帮忙。\n大家一起让奈绪的Center公演成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "47f84dec4feae2034a112eea60a3a8a2dcf9889b43efcf2e04c5d3fb0f6ec50d", "ja": "うんうん！　奈緒ちゃん、頑張ろうねっ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！小绪，我们一起加油♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "50a669a794f02a1704ed83e9939d157278e37234855a778f99b9fd141231c23a", "ja": "のり子も美奈子も、ありがとうな！\nうう、ホンマ私は仲間に恵まれてるわ～。", "zh": "法子还有美奈子，谢谢你们啰！\n呜呜，我真的受到同伴好多帮助啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "d62bcdd5d95794a2ddc79ca26e79197d65c6a9f20f3e609f7355b91845cd5a4b", "ja": "あはは、大げさだって！　それじゃあ、\nまずは何から始める？　歌？　それともダンス？", "zh": "哈哈哈，你反应也太夸张了！\n那首先要从什么开始？歌唱？还是舞蹈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "f50870b339742d028d390714f81e96f61e2ad630028819af43576b24ed381986", "ja": "トークを挟んで、前半と後半のパートがあるから……\nうーん？", "zh": "表演分成前半和后半，中间是谈话时间……\n嗯──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "2a0624948a2f5e0277c8671962c91d2a280cbb4e05bcfb5cb5ea391d7328831c", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "小法，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "905cbed1deca36b204cabefcf0e6b12f6dbca02fb5d16a58e77a62f8378f2507", "ja": "いや、公演のセンターって、トークを仕切る必要が\nあるから……しゃべる時間も多くなるよね？", "zh": "没事，我只是在想，公演的Center要负责主持……\n所以讲话的时间会比平常还多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "a6e6ea87da8154450e35b378a2c43b33b86dfcaade9e14d244a64dbeaecdc712", "ja": "ってことは、トークを磨くのも必要なんじゃ……。", "zh": "这样的话，就需要磨炼口才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "21be843116857610b82d7804a7864aa829d2ff71bc4860b29c8434556ab12d5b", "ja": "そうかも！　私もセンターの時は、\nいつもよりたくさんしゃべった気がする……。", "zh": "好像是耶！我当Center时，\n感觉也比平常说了更多的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "2e0914d39a066fd1806c36c7f66042403b1d73081878d3ee8563f80864b5cba2", "ja": "それやったら心配いらんわ！\n私、しゃべりは得意やし♪", "zh": "如果是那件事，不需要担心啦！\n我最擅长说话啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "92d4896bcbb885e210f36d38c7c0e1afeff372961c31d4b6d787ad5084e1ae05", "ja": "ん？　しゃべり……、しゃべり！？\nせや、しゃべりこそ気いつけなアカンかったんや！", "zh": "嗯？说话……说话！？\n对吼，说话的部分我才该特别小心才对呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c28b17647f64f0b948d79d660232d7e465a020a81b010efcbd3f9352fd25eb58", "ja": "しゃべりに気をつける……？\nどうしてまた？", "zh": "要小心说话的部分……？\n为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "f47581a9f42151df9b04e686d80772b7d9212c50843ae9fe726ab134f61950c0", "ja": "だって、センターってことは、思いっきり\nアイドルらしくせんとアカンってことやろ？", "zh": "因为既然是Center，\n就得表现得很有偶像的感觉才行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e93c747a8dfe6b5765368d9d505eac1b9d68e679b2f05a571b4ec1037293bf9", "ja": "は？　そういうもんだっけ？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "a5ce8c87679680766e99a150d615555b6ea7871f7db5d74cdd3c995e06926e6d", "ja": "う～ん、私たちアイドルの真ん中に立つわけだから、\nアイドルらしくないよりは、らしい方がいい……かな？", "zh": "唔～因为会站在我们这些偶像的正中央，\n所以比起不像偶像，有偶像的感觉会更好……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "68720441eb19435effe2437f7da6bd2681cbf894401edf511e76b6aab4d1f44c", "ja": "せやろ？　で、アイドルらしさと言えば……\nズバリ、東京弁や！", "zh": "对啊，所以说到有偶像的感觉……\n重点就是东京腔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "e9b53921b34853ab41b675f82955f8a1e04e495511fd5158516c12f24c735414", "ja": "いや、ホンマやって！　東京弁でトークした方が、\nぜったいアイドルらしくなるんやって！", "zh": "我说的是真的啦！用东京腔来讲话，\n绝对会变得比较像偶像啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "e13e75ddb91018198a90bf2b394b1391e60ad8e01d7aaec3acb2f3d7974104aa", "ja": "そ、そうかな？", "zh": "是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "8fca92d39c687f3d27fca83bfe42c60a306d56f61bc9a7606d6639a565f6493a", "ja": "う～ん、あんまりピンとこないな～。\n奈緒ちゃん、ためしにやってみてくれる？", "zh": "唔～有点难理解耶～\n小绪，你可以示范一次看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "1b11aa5392b54518e374f68187e34a8db0c4a87c20c2426db1b411aaee89371a", "ja": "しゃーないな……。ほな、よう見ときや！", "zh": "真拿你们没办法……你们听好了嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "0c8d59291667c7425a66cba9dd03ac7c43c10ecb8721cbcb8fe04ac4664546e4", "ja": "今まで、地道に密かに練習を重ねてきた東京弁。\nついにお披露目やで～！", "zh": "我一直以来偷偷努力练习的东京腔，\n终于要拿出来表演啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1032_p", "source_sha256": "95408a1e3e1594fd03891d57daab7f241125dfcb12f34b4cf952c3e4a04518e5", "ja": "（何だか話が変な方向に向かってる気もするけど、\nもう少し様子を見てみよう……）", "zh": "（虽然觉得话题开始朝奇怪的方向发展，\n但就再观察一下吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "8b1883f7f982a7cf7ea4d5f943518a18f350197ba7f58a22e9a88a2e13b88cdc", "ja": "コホン……。\nみんな～！　今日は来てくれてありがとう～！", "zh": "咳咳……\n大家～！谢谢你们今天来参加演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
