{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "5a94b063496dbb028083588157ade0515d9c0ff0ccbfea2b7811425ecf02613f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nトークのお題、お願いします！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n请你出问答的题目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1038_p", "source_sha256": "2ce586fb6bef47ba53d97bcff37c425c2b3a504649a50baabfe3e11bd3ecce51", "ja": "それじゃあ、えっと……最近嬉しかったことで。", "zh": "那么，我想想……请说说最近让你觉得很开心的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "e200d785b9419fb352d870877c83d129deb78b290b1d9004c83c811efc65ee2e", "ja": "よっしゃ！　最近、一番嬉しかったことは……\nやっぱり、センターになれたことやんな♪", "zh": "好！我最近觉得很开心的事情……\n当然是当上Center啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "837cb467a01630765adebe392de6765585bfba3a5b1a2c868a4966321a6d3580", "ja": "……じゃなくて！　センターになれたことかな♪\nずっと夢やった……じゃなくて、夢だった……のです。", "zh": "……不对！应该是当上Center吧♪\n我想当很久啦……不对，我想当很久……了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "5c8d0267b6b3aa63487e0fc419cdaa0fcfbd0b7e40e889c9a1c1aff878fd8593", "ja": "キラキラしたみんなの笑顔を見ることができて、\nホンマ嬉し……ほんまは嬉しい……うぅ……。", "zh": "能够看到大家耀眼的笑容，\n我真的超……超级开心……唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1042_p", "source_sha256": "48624bb761db36828276e2104aa5ab0bc562295fdf342d10cfad66900776f20f", "ja": "……奈緒、大丈夫か？", "zh": "……奈绪，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "778d43656fc9d8ed846749d8765fbd978f529501f74540cc92b9bf68c5b7d9f4", "ja": "あかん……。いちいち意識してしゃべらんと、\n東京弁にできひん……。", "zh": "不行……如果不注意每一句话，\n就没办法说出东京腔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1044_043nor", "source_sha256": "8830cf4ca19d77b6ff9e3b218ff23bf3e915b1e4ffdc835dfee70a939cabce70", "ja": "うーん。その調子だと、奈緒の東京弁トークの\nお披露目は、ちょっと難しそうだね。", "zh": "嗯～照这样看来，\n奈绪要表演用东京腔说话，好像有点难耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1045_019min", "source_sha256": "3e79b619983282d3837a0081949176886af7fa8b49c87bae1b0586d59eff9e47", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。あんまり言い直してると、\nお客さんも困っちゃいそうだし。", "zh": "呵呵，好像是呢。要是太常重说，\n观众也会觉得困扰吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "2baff46b704a5949ce9a738c245873f2d6b667728d5d3edba08b2eabfa9726fe", "ja": "まさか、こんなところに落とし穴があるなんて……。\nどないしよ～！？　このままじゃライブが……！", "zh": "没想到我会败在这种地方……\n怎么办啦～！？再这样下去演唱会就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "9fd2bc94266ca0f593d5c2c49a7c7865c626c422597b867ec7c9af03a1b15dad", "ja": "ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん！\nやっぱり私には、センターなんて早すぎるわ～！", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生！\n果然让我当Center还太早了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_1048", "source_sha256": "023da631ac37944729965353f4d52ad26a44d9edbf8fdb8b44d21941b110ac71", "ja": "なんでやねん！", "zh": "搞什么呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2000_p", "source_sha256": "64f8dd181611c67c9be250526e84330859f42f024e8738bfde0be06eeecdcb38", "ja": "なんでやねん！　……っと。\n何も早すぎないから大丈夫だよ、奈緒。", "zh": "搞什么呀！\n完全不会太早，所以你放心吧，奈绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "1d9d50697ee570e9caf495218405fd5d26efa50e6bc4546550f803641db3bce7", "ja": "{$P$}さぁん……。\n大丈夫ってことは、私……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你要我放心的意思是，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2002_037nao", "source_sha256": "503b7137f4d7d3f24ed7690235d35c81a3d73783fc8e79a17af597fd3ede3d22", "ja": "今からでも、スラスラ東京弁で\nしゃべれるようになれるってことですね？", "zh": "就算从现在开始练，\n也能讲得出一口很溜的东京腔吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2003_p", "source_sha256": "063000a624fc7e04d01640a6d16efc74f1f7442475da3a900d7ee3b523ddc767", "ja": "いや、それは難しいと思う。", "zh": "不是，那应该有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "ac9a4ef82dc14b41e26418bad02c246fdf1940300e42d8c67c3193521f9787d3", "ja": "ええ～！　アカンやないですか！\nセンター言うたら、東京弁なんですって！", "zh": "咦咦～！这样不就糟了吗？\n说到Center，就一定要讲东京腔啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "5c7ff415eee991d590fbf7353396f9b86129e2c3303139abf6c089e2792b34c7", "ja": "関西弁でトークすると、こう、\nどうしてもコントみたいになってもうて……。", "zh": "如果用关西腔来讲话，\n那就……感觉就会像在演短剧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2006_037nao", "source_sha256": "0265887fee982f8090b296e01581eebecfad742a2ab0fa7a7eff33b5c1e761d1", "ja": "私、初めてのセンターなんやから、\nアイドルらしくビシッと決めたいんです！", "zh": "这是我第一次当Center，\n我希望好好表现出偶像的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2007_p", "source_sha256": "413e385f00449a2996e1722f793b8476a086aba638aa04bb6cfd68c0cbcbf494", "ja": "アイドルらしく、か……。そうだな。\nだからこそ、奈緒は関西弁のままでいてほしいんだ。", "zh": "偶像的感觉吗……？你说得对。\n正是因为这样，我希望奈绪继续说关西腔就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2008_037nao", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2009_p", "source_sha256": "58ab0f3666e28077d193d93228482510b6eda0cf6aaa1a62b5ec622514a9bef3", "ja": "奈緒の初センター公演に来てくれるお客さんが観たいの\nは、どこかのアイドルっぽい誰かじゃなくて……。", "zh": "来看奈绪第一次Center公演的观众，\n想看的不是像其他偶像的某个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2010_p", "source_sha256": "8d54a92d17c842b90030e906d0a488ab46fc997e933d52ea562576fa1410fedf", "ja": "自分らしさを思いきり発揮して、堂々と胸を張っている\n新しいアイドル……じゃないかな。", "zh": "而是尽全力展现出自己的魅力，\n抬头挺胸、充满自信的全新偶像……不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "8b70b2dc9bcae9e0a76d1e379ccab6c91f536c637dd7ea0c2019ad322b18cc05", "ja": "新しい……アイドル……？", "zh": "全新……偶像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2012_019min", "source_sha256": "991aa618b7c53b171d99b1598e697173051c6f919647b03c021fdb46fd91de44", "ja": "そっか。関西弁じゃない奈緒ちゃんが新鮮なのって、\nただ……奈緒ちゃんらしくないってだけなのかも！", "zh": "原来是这样。不讲关西腔的小绪之所以很新鲜，\n或许……只是因为感觉不像小绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2013_037nao", "source_sha256": "5bd64af47b2554285f3d22d50d4afcb39dcf74cb30d8ff1589caa9601c76e52b", "ja": "あ！　そ、それは～。", "zh": "啊！那、那是因为～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2014_043nor", "source_sha256": "3dba6d09542d68f4ddad6454312d21c338977980eb37cb952dabc3e4d7576f98", "ja": "そうだよ！　らしくない方がいいわけないって。\nやっぱ奈緒は、ボケたりツッコんだりしてくれないと！", "zh": "就是说啊！不像自己怎么可能会比较好。\n奈绪还是要会装傻跟吐槽才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2015_p", "source_sha256": "4b6384866b3cd8d1a46fa86880b3e1ac456f8920b8953b445b04412d9a671606", "ja": "ふたりもこう言ってるけど、奈緒はどう思う？", "zh": "她们都这么说了，奈绪你怎么想呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2016_037nao", "source_sha256": "8db3b1487a885661197a2bf31e14100f5eb2e7f013ff4b91c06eca001dd41281", "ja": "私は……。", "zh": "我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2017_037nao", "source_sha256": "99825a508a9ebbbc0620a6b17e7d78959ba0fc6d9755c6ba0370cf40376bb7d9", "ja": "えっと…………。\n私、このままでええんかな？", "zh": "那个…………\n我维持原样就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2018_043nor", "source_sha256": "900f7f23bc7ff0f9a390e3ff3bdbfc4fb3951903979177fd4c16c6b0ff0289cc", "ja": "いいと思う！　私も、いつもの奈緒でいてくれた方が、\n絶対ステージを楽しめそうだし！", "zh": "我觉得很好！我也认为奈绪照平常的样子，\n绝对更能尽情地去表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2019_019min", "source_sha256": "31379f59f03d40b510f590a89986a9c24d9150ed47684e80b99ee65a1c4f006e", "ja": "いつもの奈緒ちゃんで、いつも通りにやってみようよ。\nその方がきっと、みんな笑顔になれるよ！", "zh": "小绪你就做自己，照平常那样去试试看吧。\n这样肯定更能让大家露出笑容喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2020_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c348b7ecae1c5e717721b899efa3a065511f9d9993749a79f1a4c16506b1f6d", "ja": "せ……、せやな！　どっちみち、まだ東京弁で\nうまいことしゃべられへんし、しゃーないな。", "zh": "对……对吼！反正不管怎么练，\n都没办法用东京腔好好说话，那就算了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
