{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2031_p", "source_sha256": "942f27a56f9932bec6d70bf88748365f01992d9617894de94fbfb799ef7d5dbd", "ja": "奈緒？　こんな時間にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "奈绪？这么晚来找我，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2032_037nao", "source_sha256": "124a660442a96cc5a77dc92ee3015c647db894e32624e6168a002bec3e0f2df0", "ja": "えへへ、なんでもないんですけど……。ただ、\n{$P$}さん、まだおるかな～って。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，没什么事啦……只是来看看\n{$P$}先生还在不在～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2033_037nao", "source_sha256": "e3662a13f63bef670c071bcc91d387a6d1f0341fa687686749fc034b6d25b343", "ja": "なぁなぁ、まだおるなら、\n私もここにおってええ？", "zh": "欸欸，既然你还在，\n那我也可以待在这吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2034_p", "source_sha256": "f0997150b1eb9438d42a52de1fdd98d75853803983541a62a6b799d81ff12df9", "ja": "いいけど、明日はライブだろ？\n早く帰らなくていいのか？", "zh": "可以是可以，但明天是演唱会吧？\n你不早点回去没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2035_037nao", "source_sha256": "2a392adbb9f7a6016616ab6a8da89d7ce16530ac5f6a62abf0e0bfdf06b2beba", "ja": "ライブ前やから、来たんです～。", "zh": "就是因为快要演唱会，所以我才来的呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2036_p", "source_sha256": "31d64ab70ce7e7bef75559e5cb0f5768d71053360642b908dd9d4d5cb442ead6", "ja": "ライブだから……。\nそうか、なるほどな。", "zh": "因为快演唱会……\n这样啊，原来是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_2037", "source_sha256": "04eade92432948b208bdc4169ba4e762591425b7a99fb79b5d2f7153e9d2cb3d", "ja": "奈緒なら大丈夫", "zh": "奈绪一定没问题", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3000_p", "source_sha256": "7e8a939c2e093bcad5ec9f22b822bfea1313ede470a3897be03b5cfcb7c388e7", "ja": "心配いらないよ。のり子と美奈子も言ってただろ？\n奈緒の笑顔を見ると、元気になれるって。", "zh": "不用担心。法子和美奈子也说过了吧？\n只要看到奈绪的笑容，就会打起精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3001_p", "source_sha256": "76ce77050c28903010b33f5f9701f9a129b773e5c5efbbba029f80725949fc73", "ja": "難しく考えず、いつも通りにステージを楽しむといい。\nそうすれば、お客さんは喜んでくれるから。", "zh": "你不要想得太复杂，像平常那样享受表演就可以了。\n这样一来，观众肯定也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3002_037nao", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3003_037nao", "source_sha256": "5dd49601feb8e8b6d5ba07ae275f83c1e050f7c7b18806832e137511a8f5fe4d", "ja": "あはは、さすが{$P$}さんや。\n私が怖気づいたんも、お見通しやな～。", "zh": "哈哈哈，真不愧是{$P$}先生。\n连我在害怕都被你看穿了呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3004_p", "source_sha256": "0a3433eb4147edbb6a062a84c889ae5a87c52fc6d1fc2db6b02a2503adec27e7", "ja": "そりゃあ、初センターだからな。\n直前になって、緊張がぶり返すのも当たり前だよ。", "zh": "毕竟这是你第一次当Center。\n表演前一天会觉得紧张也是人之常情喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3005_p", "source_sha256": "5f8eaf1ad07b947dbad7410cb851e552791000d791497a1de106688cf0e80b3c", "ja": "でも、奈緒なら大丈夫だよ。そういう緊張感も\nひっくるめて、思いっきり、楽しんでこい！", "zh": "不过奈绪一定没问题。\n连同那份紧张感一起，全心全意地去享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3006_037nao", "source_sha256": "f1944e0183f1c958bc697b69b20b789353a69d683379644abbf711d7b2283846", "ja": "うん。泣いても笑っても、もう明日やもんな……。\nうんっ！", "zh": "嗯，不管结果怎么样，就是明天了啊……\n嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3007_037nao", "source_sha256": "e8f5bc0f848ede3a66e312f83daa2cc5d051a41b788aa0f3002573756d1acb22", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとう！\nおかげで、なんやスッキリしましたっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你呀！\n多亏你的鼓励，我现在觉得心情舒畅多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3008_037nao", "source_sha256": "ec8269f769ce8d31c6f56f2696eba2b544ddc87ec4b26ececc4f0cd7d6f399c3", "ja": "せっかく{$P$}さんが思い出させて\nくれたんやし。明日は絶対成功させるな！", "zh": "既然{$P$}先生都让我想起来了，\n我一定会让明天的表演成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3009_037nao", "source_sha256": "648ec09742e63a03815e902adf09cb59988ac2cbe25ef444338d33c288a29c73", "ja": "お客さんみんなを、メッチャ楽しませて、\nメッチャ元気にしてくるから、楽しみにしとってな！", "zh": "我会让观众都玩得超级开心、\n每个人都变得充满活力，你要好好期待嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3010_p", "source_sha256": "c5a6f51a71215df148e93e33f83089dbd4ec7c865db4b547d0348d2bd2fbe4e6", "ja": "ああ、楽しみにしてるよ！", "zh": "嗯，我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_011_3011_p", "source_sha256": "eca517052ad75cbfffdd1e5847a8e1dd2f0e03c585283d44e4fc140e3edb001e", "ja": "（不安もプレッシャーも、センターにはつきものだ。\nでも奈緒なら、笑顔と元気に変えていけるだろう！）", "zh": "（不安也好，压力也罢，都是Center的必经之路。\n但如果是奈绪，肯定能让这些转变成笑容和活力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
